  "body": "Welcome to 21 Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa - a beautifully crafted, north-facing home in the growing Strathmill community.\r\n\r\nThe instructions are clear - all genuine offers will be presented.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing into something easy-care, or searching for a smart investment, this brand-new home combines modern design, low-maintenance living and an excellent Orewa location.\r\n\r\nModern Living Made Easy\r\nThoughtfully designed for comfort and convenience, this home features:\r\n• 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n• Master suite with ensuite\r\n• Stylish family bathroom\r\n• Internal-access garage\r\n• Additional off-street parking\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Quality modern finishes throughout\r\n\r\nThe Heart of the Home\r\nAt the centre of the home is a contemporary kitchen featuring quality appliances, excellent storage and a practical layout designed for both entertaining and everyday living.\r\n\r\nWhether hosting friends or enjoying a quiet evening at home, the open-plan design creates an inviting space to come together.\r\n\r\nSoak Up the Sun\r\nPositioned on a sunny north-facing site, this home enjoys fantastic natural light and easy indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nStep outside to your own low-maintenance outdoor space - perfect for summer BBQs, morning coffee or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nA Location You'll Love\r\nSet within the thriving Strathmill community, you're conveniently positioned close to:\r\n\r\n• Orewa Beach\r\n• Cafés and restaurants\r\n• Shopping centres and supermarkets\r\n• Schools and childcare\r\n• Motorway access\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Want to View\r\n• Brand-new home\r\n• Sunny north-facing position\r\n• Modern finishes\r\n• Low-maintenance living\r\n• Excellent lock-up-and-leave option\r\n• Ideal for families, downsizers and investors\r\n\r\nMake Your Move\r\nIf you've been looking for a brand-new home in Orewa, 21 Mahinga Kai Road deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nWith all genuine offers to be presented, now is the time to come through, see the home for yourself and put your best offer forward.\r\n\r\nVisit the Team Steenberg Sales Office daily between 12:00pm-2:00pm, and let one of our team show you through the home.",
